      "content": "i thought i was doing the right thing. i thought if i spoke up about what was happening at the agency, things would actually change. instead, they just crushed me. lost my job, my reputation, everything. my family won't even look at me right now. it feels like i traded my entire life just to prove a point that nobody even cares about. i'm just tired of fighting a world that's this broken.",
