      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks but it doesnt really change reality. the integrity part doesn't pay the bills or bring back the people i used to know. it just feels like a joke. like i'm a person who tried to be good in a world that only rewards people like them. what's the point of even trying to be a decent human being when the end result is just getting destroyed? it honestly feels like the outcome was always going to be this.",
